### Feature Course — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name deleteCoursePhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cursos/{{id}}

###

# @name deleteCourseLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cursos/{{id}}/deactivate
